  "316-ba185d87": "struct BIT {\n    int n;\n    vector<long long> t;\n    BIT(int n) : n(n), t(n + 1) {\n    }\n    void add(int p, long long x) {\n        for (; p <= n; p += p & -p)\n            t[p] += x;\n    }\n    long long sum(int p) {\n        long long z = 0;\n        for (; p; p -= p & -p)\n            z += t[p];\n        return z;\n    }\n};",
